# ============================================================
#  .gitignore root — SI Kepegawaian & Presensi Tamalate
#  Tujuan utama: mencegah PII data pegawai & rahasia masuk repo.
#  CATATAN: *.csv TIDAK di-ignore (docs/sop-raw/*.csv adalah data SOP sah).
# ============================================================

# --- Data pegawai (PII): JANGAN pernah di-commit ---
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
**/storage/app/imports/

# --- Basis data runtime (bisa berisi PII riil setelah impor) ---
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
*.sqlite3
*.db

# --- Rahasia & konfigurasi lingkungan ---
.env
**/.env
.env.*
!**/.env.example

# --- Dependensi & artefak build ---
**/vendor/
**/node_modules/
**/public/build/
**/public/hot
**/public/storage

# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.log
